#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/weka.rst:60
msgid "CuFile Buffer Size Explanation"
msgstr "CuFile 缓冲区大小说明"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/weka.rst:62
msgid ""
"The backend currently pre-registers buffer space to speed up cuFile "
"operations. This buffer space is registered in VRAM so options like "
"``--gpu-memory-utilization`` from ``vllm`` should be considered when "
"setting it. For example, a good rule of thumb for H100 which generally "
"has 80GiBs of VRAM would be to start with 8GiB and set ``--gpu-memory-"
"utilization 0.85`` and depending on your workflow fine-tune it from "
"there."
msgstr "该后端目前预注册缓冲区空间以加速 cuFile 操作。此缓冲区空间在 VRAM 中注册，因此在设置时应考虑来自 ``vllm`` 的 ``--gpu-memory-utilization`` 等选项。例如，对于通常具有 80GiB VRAM 的 H100，一个好的经验法则是从 8GiB 开始，设置 ``--gpu-memory-utilization 0.85``，然后根据您的工作流程从中进行微调。"

